%!PS-Adobe-3.0
%%BoundingBox: 0 0 612 612
%%Title: Ten Boats Home, page 14: something blinks back
/Seed where { pop } { /Seed 114 def } ifelse  Seed srand
(lib/cb_book.ps) run
cb-ground
/fognight cb-light /cb-fogc [0.42 0.46 0.55] def
280 cb-harbour-sky
% the little blue boat, a faded shape in the fog, coming home
/cb-face -1 def 420 170 70 cb-gpblue cb-boat /cb-face 1 def
0 600 0.32 cb-fog
% only its lamp is sharp: a spark answering Ana's
420 70 0.05 mul sub 170 70 1.2 mul add 2 copy 40 cb-glow
newpath 2.5 0 360 arc closepath [1 0.97 0.85] cb-rgb fill
-9 140 200 60 cb-pier
40 200 120 cb-mama
/cb-arm /up def /cb-lamp true def /cb-lit true def /cb-glowr 1.2 def
100 200 86 cb-ana
/cb-arm /down def /cb-lamp false def /cb-lit false def /cb-glowr 0.8 def
cb-paper cb-rgb
(Out in the fog, something blinks back. A little light. A little boat. A little blue boat.) 56 584 500 /center cb-text pop
/cb-foliorgb cb-paper def 14 cb-folio
showpage
